  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Get the enrolment link",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open your team and choose <strong>Add hosts</strong>, then <strong>Android</strong>. Copy the link to the phone. A phone Fleet has seen before keeps its old team: move it to yours first.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/be65720cb87b22b7.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1326
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the link on the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the link and tap <strong>Enroll</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/13980932ec6c3a74.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set up the work profile",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Next</strong>, then <strong>Continue</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e7f89bb3db7e6a4b.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Accept &#x26; continue</strong> and wait a minute.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0d676c54c6c7569.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Done</strong>. The apps arrive in the work profile.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6ff5b74a5a7be991.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name the phone in Fleet",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open the phone's host and choose <strong>Edit user</strong>. Enter its device name from Deploy App, such as <code>RECON1@J2LA9U8O</code>. <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dbc3c4691c818009.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1152
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Deliver the certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Run <code>rmscep mdm-apply --force-certificate</code>. Within minutes Fleet shows the certificate installed.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2040e481b4257f80.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 498
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the phone, open the <strong>Work</strong> apps and tap <strong>Deploy App</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/84840932117af60e.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Chrome's first start",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The first time, tap <strong>Stay signed out</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0c9c55b572c71199.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose the certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Select</strong>. The certificate carries the phone's callsign.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/efdb1153e07ab530.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Signed in",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Deploy App opens as the phone's callsign.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8b76ca5323968e64.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The phone is enrolled",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Deploy App, the phone now shows as <strong>Enrolled</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/852e3c5577522e85.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
